+// Profile runs (native J3D stage 0, docs/native-j3d.md): the GX thread's time is credited to the
+// profiled object and to where its commands came from (kStreamOpOrigin: 0 other, 1 J3D material
+// lists, 2 J3D shape packets' own setup and callbacks, 3 vertex-format lists, 4 vertex and matrix
